  "pairing": "bricolage-figtree",
  "typeCharacter": "Bricolage Grotesque carries the warm, slightly quirky grotesque voice of a person rather than a studio: the h1 runs at about 7vw in weight 700, sentence case and tight leading, and section heads run at weight 600 around 3.5vw. Figtree sets running text at 18px regular with generous leading, and the list items in 22px medium.",
  "composition": "Header on the dark ground: logo top-left in a light variant, three quiet text links to the right, and one amber rectangular button with slightly rounded corners, 4px radius. Hero, about 90vh: the h1 spans columns 1 to 7 over three lines, with the lead below on columns 1 to 5 in muted text and no second button. Columns 7 to 12 hold the painted artwork, bled to the right edge: a tall slanted shape of warm window light falling across a dark floor and wall. Next comes a full-width amber band with a ribbon of short words naming the six subjects, separated by small dark dots, in dark ink at 3vw. Services section on the dark ground: the heading sits on columns 1 to 4 with a short note about the gallery delivery times below it. Columns 6 to 12 hold a ruled list of the six offerings, each row with the name in 22px text colour and its note to the right in muted text, divided by 1px rules in the border colour. Story section: a surface-coloured field covers columns 1 to 6, holding the heading and the paragraph about Tilen, Prekmurje, Štajerska and Hrvaška, and the weddings figure. Columns 8 to 12 carry a single small amber circle with three short highlight lines beside it, about natural light, no long posing, and studio by appointment only. Call section on the dark ground: the heading spans columns 1 to 7, the phone sits below it as a large amber numeral, and the email and address follow in text colour. Columns 9 to 12 hold a simple schematic line map of Lendavska ulica in muted lines, with an amber dot. The footer is a thin rule with the logo and the address.",
  "imagery": "No photographs at all. The hero holds one painted artwork in gouache: a soft-edged parallelogram of warm amber and honey light, divided by thin shadow bars of window mullions, falling diagonally across an empty dark floor and wall. It is painted on a plain #15140f ground, with no window frame, objects or people, and kept apart from the text. A second, much smaller painted patch of the same light sits on the dark ground near the map in the call section. The amber circle in the story section is a flat CSS shape echoing the dot on the logo's camera.",
  "signature": "A slanted patch of painted window light falling across the dark hero, the only light on the page, matched by the amber dot of the logo.",
  "copy": {
    "headline": "Fotografiram s svetlobo, ki je že v prostoru",
    "lead": "Poroke, družine, nosečnice, novorojenčki, poslovni portreti in izdelki. Sproščeno, v naravni svetlobi in brez dolgega postavljanja, v Murski Soboti in po Prekmurju."
  },
  "imagePrompt": "One flat full-page screenshot of a desktop homepage, 1536x1024 px, with no browser window, no device frame and no perspective. The page ground is a deep near-black #15140f, the main text is warm light grey #ece8de, muted text is #a19b8e, and hairline rules are #3a372e. The single strong colour is amber #e9a51c. The layout uses a 12-column grid with generous margins, and nothing is centred. Header: the attached Rozman Fotografija logo at the top left in a light variant on the dark ground, three small Figtree text links to the right, and one amber rectangular button with a 4px radius and dark #15140f text. Hero: a very large Bricolage Grotesque bold headline in sentence case and tight leading spans the left seven columns over three lines in #ece8de, with a short Figtree paragraph below in #a19b8e. There is no other button. The right five columns, bleeding off the right edge, hold a painted gouache artwork: a tall slanted parallelogram of warm amber and honey sunlight falling diagonally across an empty dark floor and wall, crossed by soft thin shadow bars from window mullions, with soft painterly edges. It is painted on a plain #15140f ground with no window frame, no objects, no people and no letters, and is clearly separated from the text. Below the hero is a full-width amber #e9a51c band holding one line of large dark #15140f Bricolage Grotesque words separated by small dark round dots. Services section on the dark ground: a semibold heading at the left in columns 1 to 4 with a small muted note below it. In columns 6 to 12 is a ruled list of six rows, each with the name in medium 22px light text on the left and a short muted note on the right, divided by thin #3a372e lines. Story section: a slightly lighter #211f19 flat field covers the left half, holding a heading and a paragraph. On the right of the section are a flat amber circle and three short text lines beside it. Call section on the dark ground: a large heading at the left, below it a phone number set as a big amber Bricolage Grotesque numeral, then the email and address in light text. On the right is a simple schematic street map drawn in thin #a19b8e lines with one amber dot, and a small soft painted patch of amber window light nearby on the plain dark ground. Footer: a thin rule with the small logo and the address. The styling is flat throughout: no gradients, no shadows, no glass effects, no pill buttons, no icons and no photographs."
}

